# Normalise to LF in the repository. The CI workflows use bash heredocs
# (<<'PY'), and a CRLF sneaking into one stops the terminator from matching,
# which fails in a way that reads like a Python error rather than a line-ending
# problem. Pin the text types explicitly rather than relying on autodetection.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf

*.png   binary
*.uf2   binary
*.zip   binary
